  "description": "sessions.ended_retention is a required runtime core-wide positive Go duration, optional in the additive schema with no default. U2 loader tests must refuse missing, zero (0, 0s, 0h0m), negative, malformed, wrong-type and overflowing durations, accept positive representable durations, and prove templates supply 168h with no code default or test-login/per-target exception. Zero and overflow are prose bounds enforced by the loader, like the existing duration knobs. No page-size or sweep knob. Published e4 so surfaces can build against the shape; required-green e5 so the addition does not retroactively fail the existing e4 provider.",
